Why      specs/openehr/ITS-REST/specifications/responses/409_EHR_with_id.yaml, description:
         &quot;The server SHOULD send an ETag.&quot;
         https://example.org/409_EHR_with_id.yaml
Expected status 409
Received no ETag header
Exchange PUT http://sut/ehr/3f2a -&gt; 201   (recording entry 2)
Whose    advisory: the server did not follow a SHOULD; this row never counts against a capability</system-out>
    </testcase>
  </testsuite>
